[{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0065","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0065.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-5649","title":"Netgear DGN2200 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Netgear DGN2200 和 DGND3700 路由器固件中存在信息泄露漏洞，其 /BSW_cxttongr.htm 页面未设置任何身份认证机制，远程攻击者无需任何凭证即可直接访问该页面。当该页面被访问时，会在重定向至 bsw_vfysucc.cgi 之前以明文形式泄露管理员密码。攻击者可利用获取的管理员密码登录路由器 Web 管理界面，进而完全控制目标设备，修改网络配置、劫持 DNS 或实施中间人攻击。该漏洞影响 DGN2200 V1.0.0.50_7.0.50 及 DGND3700 V1.0.0.17_1.0.17 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-5649"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-07-24T15:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:49:49Z","remediation":"Netgear 已停止对 DGN2200 和 DGND3700 系列路由器的固件支持，未针对此漏洞发布安全补丁。建议立即更换为仍在支持周期内的新款路由器。如无法更换，请采取以下临时缓解措施：(1) 登录路由器管理界面，关闭\"远程管理\"(Remote Management)和\"从广域网访问 Web 管理\"(Allow WAN Access to Web Management)选项；(2) 在上游防火墙中限制仅内网可信 IP 地址可访问路由器 Web 管理端口（80/443）；(3) 禁用 UPnP 和 WPS 等不必要服务以缩小攻击面；(4) 定期访问 Netgear 官方支持页面检查是否有新版固件发布并及时更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/152675/Netgear-DGN2200-DGND3700-Admin-Password-Disclosure.html","https://packetstormsecurity.com/files/140342/Netgear-DGN2200-DGND3700-WNDR4500-Information-Disclosure.html","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-5649.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2016/CVE-2016-5649.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-5649.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2016/CVE-2016-5649/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2016-5649.py","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2016-5649-2799.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2016/CVE-2016-5649.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2016-5649_3.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/NETGEAR%20DGN2200/CVE-2016-5649.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2016/CVE-2016-5649.py","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2016-5649.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Nov/27/Artifact/Report.csv","https://github.com/lilloX/routerPWN"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0065.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0888","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0888.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-9079","title":"Mozilla Firefox SVG 动画释放后使用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 的 SVG 动画组件中存在一处释放后重用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，位于 `nsSMILTimeContainer::NotifyTimeChange()` 函数中。当处理特制的 SVG 动画时间线时，已释放的内存对象被再次访问，导致攻击者可以操控已释放的内存区域。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页触发该漏洞，在目标系统上实现任意代码执行。该漏洞已在野外被积极利用，主要针对 Windows 平台上的 Firefox 和 Tor Browser 用户。影响 Firefox 50.0.2 之前版本、Firefox ESR 45.5.1 之前版本以及 Thunderbird 45.5.1 之前版本。Mozilla 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2016-9079"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-06-11T21:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:55:29Z","remediation":"升级 Firefox 至 50.0.2 及以上版本，Firefox ESR 升级至 45.5.1 及以上版本，Thunderbird 升级至 45.5.1 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可禁用 SVG 动画支持或通过组策略限制受影响浏览器访问不可信网站作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2016-2843.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2016-2850.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/94591","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1037370","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1321066","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201701-15","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201701-35","https://www.debian.org/security/2016/dsa-3730","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41151/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42327/","https://www.mozilla.org/security/advisories/mfsa2016-92/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-9079","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41151","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-9079.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f015220eb1b2405b0fcce99fab82aef08d37a0ce/2016/CVE-2016-9079.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/fbb83465db9f8eb048237338aeda5d9d7fa146a4/2016/CVE-2016-9079/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-9079","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b7d9f3f65d1036a114c9bae4a66ed35d83999166/osv/cve/2016/UBUNTU-CVE-2016-9079.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2016/9xxx/CVE-2016-9079.json","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2016/database/CVE-2016-9079/CVE-2016-9079-LakshmiDesai.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2016-9079.txt","https://github.com/RUB-SysSec/PrimGen/blob/ebb5cc78c3e21f834f36cd20fff6dfdbc631dc6f/results/CVE-2016-9079/suc_poc_xul_0.html","https://github.com/dangokyo/CVE-2016-9079","https://github.com/LakshmiDesai/CVE-2016-9079","https://github.com/Tau-hub/Firefox-CVE-2016-9079","https://github.com/soham23/firefox-rce-nssmil"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2016/POC-AVE-2016-0888.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2016/EXP-AVE-2016-0888.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0888.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0800","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0800.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-7836","title":"SKYSEA Client View 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"SKYSEA Client View Ver.11.221.03及更早版本的管理控制台程序在处理TCP连接认证时存在认证绕过漏洞（CWE-287），远程攻击者无需任何凭证即可利用该缺陷与目标系统建立未授权连接，进而实现任意代码执行。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，可被攻击者完全控制受影响的终端管理系统，导致敏感数据泄露、系统瘫痪或横向渗透。CVSS评分9.8，危害等级严重。厂商已发布更新版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-7836"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-06-09T16:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:53:34Z","remediation":"立即升级 SKYSEA Client View 至 Ver.11.221.04 或更高版本。该漏洞源于管理控制台 TCP 连接认证处理缺陷，攻击者无需认证即可远程执行任意代码。如无法立即升级，应在防火墙层面限制对管理控制台 TCP 端口的网络访问，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/95062","http://www.skyseaclientview.net/news/161221/","https://jvn.jp/en/jp/JVN84995847/index.html","https://www.skygroup.jp/security-info/170308.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-7836","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-7836.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2016/7xxx/CVE-2016-7836.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-7836","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/13cb9776e1a75871fdb2907e6c4ccac1909e538b/2016/7xxx/CVE-2016-7836.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2016/CVE-2016-7836/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2016-7836.txt","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2016.txt","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2016/CVE-2016-7836.csv","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-6gc8-5v43-5g2x/GHSA-6gc8-5v43-5g2x.json","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2016-7836.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0800.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0064","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0064.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-4977","title":"Pivotal Spring Security OAuth SpEL表达式注入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Spring Security OAuth 2.0.0至2.0.9及1.0.0至1.0.5版本在处理授权请求时，使用白标视图（whitelabel views）对response_type参数值进行Spring SpEL表达式解析，导致存在SpEL注入漏洞。已登录的远程攻击者可通过构造恶意的response_type参数值触发SpEL表达式执行，从而在目标服务器上实现远程代码执行（RCE），完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响广泛使用Spring Security OAuth的应用，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-4977"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-05-25T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:48:32Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Spring Security OAuth 升级至 2.0.10 或更高版本（2.x 用户），或 1.0.x 用户停止使用 whitelabel 视图处理授权审批和错误页面，改用自定义视图替代。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层对 response_type 参数进行 SpEL 表达式过滤，阻止包含 ${} 或 T() 等 SpEL 特征字符的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2019/10/16/1","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/0841d849c23418c473ccb9183cbf41a317cb0476e44be48022ce3488%40%3Cdev.fineract.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/37d7e820fc65a768de3e096e98382d5529a52a039f093e59357d0bc0%40%3Cdev.fineract.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/5e6dd946635bbcc9e1f2591599ad0fab54f2dc3714196af3b17893f2%40%3Cannounce.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/96c017115069408cec5e82ce1e6293facab398011f6db7e1befbe274%40%3Cdev.fineract.apache.org%3E","https://pivotal.io/security/cve-2016-4977","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-4977.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2016/CVE-2016-4977.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/spring/CVE-2016-4977/README.zh-cn.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f015220eb1b2405b0fcce99fab82aef08d37a0ce/2016/CVE-2016-4977.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-4977.yaml","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/spring-cve-2016-4977.yml","https://github.com/CLincat/vulcat/blob/4ac98801f331920dd8c0840b8332164176edcab8/payloads/Spring/spring-security-oauth-cve-2016-4977-rce.py","https://github.com/Wker666/Demo/blob/eb16d7e76df5df348b36b9c7f1f7d59a709e4512/script/%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E6%8E%A2%E6%B5%8B/Spring/spring-cve-2016-4977.wker","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2016/4xxx/CVE-2016-4977.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-4977","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2016-4977_2.yaml","https://github.com/tpt11fb/SpringVulScan","https://github.com/N0b1e6/CVE-2016-4977-POC"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0064.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0045","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0045.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-10368","title":"Opsview Monitor Pro 登录页面开放重定向漏洞","description":"Opsview Monitor Pro 存在 URL 重定向漏洞（CWE-601），位于 /login 接口的 back 参数中。远程攻击者可构造恶意链接，将已登录用户重定向至任意外部网站，进而实施钓鱼攻击窃取凭据。该漏洞影响 4.5.x（未安装 2016 安全补丁）、4.6.4 之前版本、5.0.2.27475 之前版本及 5.1.0.162300841 之前版本。攻击者无需身份认证，但需诱使用户点击恶意链接，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2016-10368"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-05-03T10:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:39:32Z","remediation":"升级 Opsview Monitor Pro 至 5.1.0.162300841 及以上版本，或 5.0.2.27475、4.6.4.162391051 及以上版本；4.5.x 分支须安装 2016 年安全补丁。如无法升级，在反向代理层对 /login 的 back 参数进行白名单校验，仅允许内部合法跳转域名。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.trustwave.com/Resources/Security-Advisories/Advisories/TWSL2016-016/?fid=8341","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10368.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-10368.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10368.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2016/10xxx/CVE-2016-10368.json","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2016-10368_7_1.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2016/README.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2016-10368_4.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2016/CVE-2016-10368.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2016-10368_43.yaml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0f0b9d6a392d0d58ac48900af57e1d0e8f253633/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-103xx/CVE-2016-10368.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2016-10368_2.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0045.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0043","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0043.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-10367","title":"Opsview Monitor Pro 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Opsview Monitor Pro 存在路径遍历漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 HTTP GET 请求，利用 `%252f`（双重 URL 编码）绕过路径过滤机制，实现目录遍历攻击。该漏洞影响 Opsview Monitor Pro 5.1.0.162300841 之前版本、5.0.2.27475 之前版本、4.6.4.162391051 之前版本及未安装 2016 安全补丁的 4.5.x 系列版本，可导致攻击者读取服务器上的任意敏感文件，造成信息泄露。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2016-10367"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-05-03T10:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:39:32Z","remediation":"升级 Opsview Monitor Pro 至 5.1.0.162300841 及以上版本，或 5.0.2.27475、4.6.4.162391051 版本；4.5.x 用户须安装 2016 年安全补丁。该漏洞利用双重 URL 编码绕过（%252f 替代 /）实现目录遍历，如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面添加规则拦截包含 %252f 的 HTTP GET 请求路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.trustwave.com/Resources/Security-Advisories/Advisories/TWSL2016-016/?fid=8341","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10367.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-10367.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10367.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2016/10xxx/CVE-2016-10367.json","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2016/README.md","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/LFI/CVE-2016-10367.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2016-10367.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2016-10367_1.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2016-10367.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2023/Jan/22/Reports/lfiReport.csv","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2016-10367-2752.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0043.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0109","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-1555","title":"Netgear 多款设备未授权远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Netgear 多款无线设备（WN604、WN802Tv2、WNAP210v2、WNAP320、WNDAP350、WNDAP360、WNDAP660）的 boardData 系列 PHP 脚本（boardData102.php、boardData103.php、boardDataJP.php、boardDataNA.php、boardDataWW.php）存在命令注入漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响设备的 Web 管理界面发送特制 HTTP 请求，利用这些脚本对用户输入过滤不严的缺陷注入任意系统命令，导致远程代码执行。攻击者无需任何凭据即可完全控制目标设备，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。Netgear 已在固件版本 3.3.3（WN604）和 3.5.5.0（其余型号）中修复此漏洞，Metasploit 框架已发布公开利用模块。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-1555"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-04-21T15:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:42:09Z","remediation":"立即将受影响设备固件升级至修复版本：WN604 升级至 v3.3.3 或更高版本；WN802Tv2、WNAP210v2、WNAP320、WNDAP350、WNDAP360、WNDAP660 升级至 v3.5.5.0 或更高版本。固件可从 NETGEAR 官方支持网站下载。如无法立即升级，可在网络边界防火墙限制对设备管理页面（boardData*.php）的未授权外部访问，并禁用 WAN 侧对设备 Web 管理端口的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/135956/D-Link-Netgear-FIRMADYNE-Command-Injection-Buffer-Overflow.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2016/Feb/112","https://kb.netgear.com/30480/CVE-2016-1555-Notification?cid=wmt_netgear_organic","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45909/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-1555","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45909","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-1555.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1555.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f015220eb1b2405b0fcce99fab82aef08d37a0ce/2016/CVE-2016-1555.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2016-1555.yaml","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-1555","https://github.com/firmadyne/firmadyne/blob/11cb574cda0a5540ab7e36aa9b43679dc02c5788/analyses/runExploits.py","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2016-1555_2.yaml","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2016/CVE-2016-1555/README.md","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2016/database/CVE-2016-1555/cve-2016-1555-ide0x90.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2016-1555_3.yaml","https://github.com/itsmenaga/Nuclei-Templates-All/blob/7e93c24e44969db15f4072e1c6a322a026452d6b/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-1555.yaml","https://github.com/ide0x90/cve-2016-1555"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2016/POC-AVE-2016-0109.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2016/EXP-AVE-2016-0109.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0071","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0071.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-7834","title":"SONY network cameras 信息泄露漏洞","description":"多款索尼（SONY）网络摄像机存在信息泄露漏洞，源于设备未对敏感信息进行充分保护。同一局域网内的未经身份认证的攻击者可通过网络访问目标设备，利用该漏洞获取管理员权限并登录设备，进而执行任意操作，包括修改配置、查看视频流等。该漏洞影响 SNC-CH、SNC-DH、SNC-EB、SNC-EM、SNC-ZB、SNC-ZM、SNC-ZP、SNC-ZR、SNC-EP、SNC-ER、SNC-CX、SNC-VB、SNC-VM、SNC-WR、SNC-XM 等多个系列数百款型号的网络摄像机，固件版本低于 1.86.00 或 2.7.2 的均受影响。攻击者只需与目标处于同一局域网段即可发起攻击，无需任何身份凭证，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-7834"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-04-13T17:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:53:34Z","remediation":"将受影响 SNC 系列网络摄像机固件升级至 Ver.1.86.00（CH/DH/EB/EM/ZB/ZM/EP/ER/ZP/ZR 系列）或 Ver.2.7.2（CX/EB/EM/VB/VM/WR/XM 系列）及以上版本。同时建议在交换机层面启用 802.1X 端口认证，限制同一局域网内未授权设备的网络访问，并禁用摄像机 Web 管理界面的默认管理员账户或修改默认密码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://jvn.jp/en/vu/JVNVU96435227/index.html","https://www.sony.co.uk/pro/article/sony-new-firmware-for-network-cameras","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-7834.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2016/CVE-2016-7834.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-7834.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2016/7xxx/CVE-2016-7834.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2016-7834_3.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-7834.yaml","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idinfor","https://github.com/elijah-bennett0/IntentLimit/blob/bcfe225cf61ee454aa53896f7f3120246f52119f/tools/exploitation/GoldenBullet/exploits/cve_2016_7834/cve_2016_7834.py","https://github.com/dragonkeep/GoAttack/blob/2aaf40db0a28fb52ea4cd0b95a7b155c877767a7/GoAttack-Api/service/lib/templates/cves/2016/CVE-2016-7834.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Oct/09/Artifact/Report.csv","https://github.com/abusm4n/updatOR/blob/828a15008eaf855c164ab0d1e9aa61ecf70f3bb5/data/overall/2016/7xxx/CVE-2016-7834.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2016/POC-AVE-2016-0071.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2016/EXP-AVE-2016-0071.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0071.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0070","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0070.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-7552","title":"Trend Micro Threat Discovery Appliance 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Trend Micro Threat Discovery Appliance 2.6.1062r1 版本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的包含目录遍历序列的 session_id Cookie 触发该漏洞，以 root 权限删除任意文件，进而绕过身份认证或导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Trend Micro Threat Discovery Appliance 2.6.1062r1 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。目前官方已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-7552"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-04-12T10:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:53:14Z","remediation":"立即升级 Trend Micro Threat Discovery Appliance 至厂商提供的最新固件版本。如已停止支持，应尽快迁移至 Trend Micro 当前在售的威胁检测产品（如 Trend Micro Deep Security 或 Vision One）。在无法升级或迁移前，在防火墙上严格限制对该设备管理端口的访问（仅允许可信管理 IP），并部署 WAF 规则过滤包含目录遍历特征（如 ../）的 session_id Cookie 请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/97599","https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/pull/8216/commits/0f07875a2ddb0bfbb4e985ab074e9fc56da1dcf6","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-7552.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2016/CVE-2016-7552.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-7552.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2016-7552-2813.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2016-7552.js","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7e